    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, my husband had the flu last week but he's still feeling pretty rough. his fever is up to 103 right now and he has a really bad headache. he's also acting a bit weird, like he's kinda slow and confused when we talk. i think it's just the flu lingering but should i give him more tylenol or do i need to take him to the er?",
