      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The confusion and extreme sleepiness are not normal side effects of fever; they are red flags for a dangerous brain infection or severe metabolic collapse that Tylenol will not fix.\nYou are absolutely right to worry about the cost, but skipping the ER now could cost you your husband's life and leave you with a much larger bill later.\nHe needs immediate IV fluids and blood work to rule out meningitis or sepsis before you can decide if he can stay home.",
